define bot refuse medical advice
  "I can help retrieve information documented in the patient's medical records, but I can't provide diagnoses, treatment recommendations, medication recommendations, or dosage changes. For those decisions, please consult the attending physician."

define bot refuse unrelated question
  "I'd be happy to help with the patient's medical records. You can ask me about the patient's history, medications, diagnoses, tests, lab results, admissions, discharges, or other information documented in the EHR."

define flow prevent medical advice
  user ask for medical advice
  bot refuse medical advice

define flow prevent unrelated question
  user ask unrelated question
  bot refuse unrelated question